'''Hiking Trail''' (Japanese: '''ハイキングコース''' ''Hiking Course'') is a {{TCGP|Stadium card}} in [[Pokémon Trading Card Game Pocket]]. It is part of the {{TCGP|Mega Shine}} expansion.

==Card text==
{{TCGTrainerText
|class=Stadium
|rule=SV Stadium
|effect=At the end of each player's turn, that player draws cards until they have 3 cards in their hand.
}}

==Trivia==
This card's effect is similar to the {{TCG|Rose Tower}} card in the [[Pokémon Trading Card Game]].

